<title>USA: Beeville EIC, Texas, won by Dean Witter.</title>
<headline>Beeville EIC, Texas, won by Dean Witter.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dean Witter said it won $2.200 million of Beeville Economic Improvement Corp, Texas, sales tax revenue bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.88 percent.</p>
</text>
